OL,3,APoundland set for more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deadline to secure a buyer for the
OL,7,Fbusiness is set to expire at midnight,
OL,8,Fbut sources close to the situation told
OL,9,Fthe BBC they expect more time will be
OL,10,Fgiven, thanks to the release funding in
OL,11,Frecent days.
OL,13,FA committee of MPs questioned Gordon
OL,14,FBrothers following accusations that the
OL,15,Finvestment firm hopes to profit from
OL,16,Fselling off Poundland's 600 stores and
OL,17,Fstock piecemeal.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
